        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Performs assessments of systems and networks within the network environment or enclave and identifies where those systems/networks deviate from acceptable configurations, enclave policy, or local policy. Measures effectiveness of defense-in-depth architecture against known vulnerabilities.</rdfs:comment>
