        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Senior official or executive with the authority to formally assume responsibility for operating an information system at an acceptable level of risk to organizational operations (including mission, functions, image, or reputation), organizational assets, individuals, other organizations, and the Nation (CNSSI 4009).</rdfs:comment>
