        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Conducts detailed investigations on computer-based crimes establishing documentary or physical evidence, to include digital media and logs associated with cyber intrusion incidents.</rdfs:comment>
