        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Conducts software and systems engineering and software systems research to develop new capabilities, ensuring cybersecurity is fully integrated. Conducts comprehensive technology research to evaluate potential vulnerabilities in cyberspace systems.</rdfs:comment>
