        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Develops detailed intelligence plans to satisfy cyber operations requirements. Collaborates with cyber operations planners to identify, validate, and levy requirements for collection and analysis. Participates in targeting selection, validation, synchronization, and execution of cyber actions. Synchronizes intelligence activities to support organization objectives in cyberspace.</rdfs:comment>
