        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Conducts independent comprehensive assessments of the management, operational, and technical security controls and control enhancements employed within or inherited by an information technology (IT) system to determine the overall effectiveness of the controls (as defined in NIST SP 800-37).</rdfs:comment>
