        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Competency can best be defined as a characteristic of a successful performer (Boyatzis, 2008; Prescott, 2012; Subramaniam et al., 2019). Competencies are crucial to the success or failure of an individual, not necessarily formal education (Draksler &amp; Širec, 2018). It is measured in relation to successfully playing a role that is expected in a particular context, demonstrated through behaviour and actions (Man et al., 2002).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Competencies</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


