        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Evaluates collection operations and develops effects-based collection requirements strategies using available sources and methods to improve collection. Develops, processes, validates, and coordinates submission of collection requirements. Evaluates performance of collection assets and collection operations.</rdfs:comment>
