        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Adversaries may manipulate software dependencies and development tools prior to receipt by a final consumer for the purpose of data or system compromise. Applications often depend on external software to function properly. Popular open source projects that are used as dependencies in many applications may be targeted as a means to add malicious code to users of the dependency.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Compromise Software Dependencies and Development Tools</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">T1195.001</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


