        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cyberseconto/Tactics"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The adversary is trying to avoid being detected.

Defense Evasion consists of techniques that adversaries use to avoid detection throughout their compromise. Techniques used for defense evasion include uninstalling/disabling security software or obfuscating/encrypting data and scripts. Adversaries also leverage and abuse trusted processes to hide and masquerade their malware. Other tactics’ techniques are cross-listed here when those techniques include the added benefit of subverting defenses.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Defense evasion</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">TA0005</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


