        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Examines data from multiple disparate sources with the goal of providing security and privacy insight. Designs and implements custom algorithms, workflow processes, and layouts for complex, enterprise-scale data sets used for modeling, data mining, and research purposes.</rdfs:comment>
