        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Conducts collection, processing, and/or geolocation of systems to exploit, locate, and/or track targets of interest. Performs network navigation, tactical forensic analysis, and, when directed, executes on-net operations.</rdfs:comment>
