        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The CompTIA Cybersecurity Analyst (CySA+) certification verifies that successful candidates have the knowledge and skills required to leverage intelligence and threat detection techniques, analyze and interpret data, identify and address vulnerabilities, suggest preventative measures, and effectively respond to and recover from incidents.</rdfs:comment>
