        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Develops assessment plans and measures of performance/effectiveness. Conducts strategic and operational effectiveness assessments as required for cyber events. Determines whether systems performed as expected and provides input to the determination of operational effectiveness.</rdfs:comment>
