        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Adversaries may grant additional permission levels, such as ReadPermission or FullAccess, to maintain persistent access to an adversary-controlled email account. The Add-MailboxPermission PowerShell cmdlet, available in on-premises Exchange and in the cloud-based service Office 365, adds permissions to a mailbox.</rdfs:comment>
